themes":{"order_wins":["**Larsen & Toubro** -- wins a \"Significant\" (Rs 1,000-2,500 cr) order with LTEPS for a 300 MW/900 MWh liquid-cooled BESS at Khavda, Gujarat (exact value not disclosed).","**Indian Emulsifiers** -- US subsidiary Polaris Specialty Chemicals bags a USD 11.98 mn (~Rs 111.82 cr) annual commitment from an undisclosed US customer (~94.9% of mcap).","**Highway Infrastructure** -- Rs 12.00 cr work order from Sacham Highway Real Estates (a related party) for the Highway Aerocity residential project, Dewas (~2.0% of mcap), 2-year execution.","**Current Infraprojects** -- empanelled as L1 bidder by Lakshadweep Electricity Department for 3 years, rooftop solar + BESS on government buildings (2,107 kW + 5,525 kWh; contract value not yet communicated).","**Indobell Insulations** -- a second US export order, USD 97,368, for Steam Turbine Insulation-Blanket Therm, a day after its USD 194,736 order to the same buyer category."],"equity_allotments":["**Steelman Telecom** -- allots 7,86,900 fully convertible warrants (25% paid, Rs 17.5 of Rs 70) to promoters Mahendra and Mayank Bindal, Rs 5.51 cr on full conversion _(new warrants, preferential)_."],"m_and_a":["**TVS Motor** -- non-binding MoU with the Tamil Nadu government to invest Rs 2,000 cr over 4 years and create 1,000 jobs (~0.9% of mcap).","**VTM Limited** -- separately signs its own non-binding MoU with the Tamil Nadu government, reiterating a commitment to invest in the state (value not disclosed).","**Nexus Select Trust** -- completes its acquisition of Diamond Plaza mall, Kolkata, for Rs 354.95 cr enterprise value (Rs 376 cr incl. capex/closing), its first East-India asset.","**Haldyn Glass** -- buys JV partner Heinz Glas's remaining 43.2% of Haldyn Heinz Fine Glass for Rs 45.15 cr, taking its stake to 100%; the JV posted Rs 123.18 cr H1 FY27 revenue at a 19% EBITDA margin."],"capex_core":["**Anondita Medicare** -- adds 245 mn pieces/year of certified male-condom capacity at Noida, Rs 75.00 cr (~3.9% of mcap), by Q4 FY27.","**Suzlon Energy** -- breaks ground on a 1 GW smart blade factory in Thoothukudi, Tamil Nadu, Rs 200 cr, ~12 months, its third Tamil Nadu plant.","**Krishca Strapping Solutions** -- expands into specialty steel via three new lines (Chennai cold-rolling 60,000 TPA, Vajra Alloys 800 TPA, Manda Stainless Gujarat 36,000 TPA greenfield), alongside H1 FY27 revenue up 9.9% YoY to Rs 101.68 cr."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 10 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**PNGS Reva Diamond Jewellery** -- 45-day Navratri-Diwali festive sales up 54.4% YoY to Rs 141.97 cr (ex-gold); Dhanteras single-day revenue up 61.1% to Rs 14.11 cr; store count now 41.","**K.V. Toys India** -- H1 FY27 total income up 27.7% YoY to Rs 102.74 cr, PAT up 18.6% to Rs 4.85 cr; board also approves a proposed investment in Play Panda, pending due diligence (value not disclosed).","**Bombay Coated & Special Steels** -- H1 FY27 revenue up 37.8% YoY to Rs 677.3 cr, PAT up 80.8% to Rs 19.9 cr; Rs 125 cr of its November IPO proceeds earmarked to cut debt-to-equity toward 1x.","**Cipla** -- US FDA approves its first generic Fluticasone HFA inhaler (110/220 mcg), a Flovent equivalent developed with Teva, for a market IQVIA estimates at USD 350 mn.","**Beta Drugs** -- receives Mexico's COFEPRIS certification for 48 oncology formulations, opening sales from FY27 into a market IQVIA sizes at USD 3.5 bn.","**Bikaji Foods International** -- enters the premium bakery segment with Mahe, a European-style brand under subsidiary Bikaji Bakes, with Master Baker T K Khaleel.","**Radico Khaitan** -- Prestige & Above volume up 35.8% YoY to 5.28 mn cases in Q2 FY27 (77.1% of IMFL sales value); luxury segment made Rs 475 cr in FY26, targeting ~25% growth in FY27."],"open_offers":["**AI Champdany Industries Ltd** — G Jerambhai Exports Limited open offer for 26.0% (79